{"id":"736eda87-78f3-4dc7-859c-66374458745c","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"dc4efabc16be5cc5","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/debug-protocol.ts","baseline":{"blob":"0fb29f5fde576747e3e291251514727b3eb54aab","start":7022,"end":7100},"shape":{"type":"TypeLiteral","atoms":["{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","terminated","\"",";","\"","exitCode","\"","?",":","number",";","\"","crash","\"","?",":","Crash",";","\"","quiet","\"","?",":","true","}"]},"context":{"before":"398c2280a2270fda","after":"0f2b2eb9f19c367e"}},"payload":{"text":"`quiet`: a live run of text that doesn't parse yet, which ran nothing and so has nothing to tell.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:22.020Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:22.020Z"}
{"id":"74ae88fd-b148-4270-bcb4-8ec2256eab20","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"57cd6dd63632471b","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/debug-protocol.ts","baseline":{"blob":"cd0272d588f4f24a53dcd436aad80b47c0b9d212","start":2987,"end":3123},"shape":{"type":"TypeLiteral","atoms":["{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","decide","\"",";","\"","deny","\"","?",":","boolean",";","\"","skip","\"","?",":","boolean",";","\"","policy","\"","?",":","Policy",";","\"","give","\"","?",":","unknown",";","\"","decided","\"","?",":","\"","once","\"","|","\"","always","\"","|","\"","refused","\"","}"]},"context":{"before":"f3eca933d1c75238","after":"0680f3644ec1907c"}},"payload":{"text":"A decision at a capability stop, before the run resumes: `deny` fails the call the stop was for; `policy`, after\n\"Allow always\", is the policy now in effect — what stops from here on; `give`, the result the call returns instead\nof being made (a rule's *give result*, just this once).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:48.345Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:48.345Z"}
{"id":"7840e32c-aa19-4e5c-87bc-f3be5cd7d989","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"dc4efabc16be5cc5","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/debug-protocol.ts","baseline":{"blob":"1d42d1f935d3e2eb3e600cfd70fdf7756a35ec19","start":6925,"end":7003},"shape":{"type":"TypeLiteral","atoms":["{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","terminated","\"",";","\"","exitCode","\"","?",":","number",";","\"","crash","\"","?",":","Crash",";","\"","quiet","\"","?",":","true","}"]},"context":{"before":"398c2280a2270fda","after":"0f2b2eb9f19c367e"}},"payload":{"text":"`crash.file`: where it threw, when that's another of the program's files than the entry.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:23.470Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:23.470Z"}
{"id":"7be41252-085d-4b85-94ee-73896bf52d9e","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"6c57aaf815e8ef6e","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/debug-protocol.ts","baseline":{"blob":"944bd8db9ecfde316a7d48a091b9235521cb2565","start":1130,"end":1300},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","type","ToWorker","=","|","{","\"","kind","\"",":","\"","runtime","\"",";","\"","port","\"",":","MessagePort","}","|","{","\"","kind","\"",":","\"","control","\"",";","\"","control","\"",":","Control",";","\"","trace","\"","?",":","{","\"","traceId","\"",":","string",";","\"","parentSpanId","\"",":","string","}","}"]},"context":{"before":"7b8dd0b87678e2e6","after":"37d7d0dacddf682a"}},"payload":{"text":"What the adapter posts its worker: first its link into the editor's runtime (editor-api's workspace runtime: its\nservers answer the preview through it, its log and spans are the editor's), then control messages — each with the\nadapter action's trace, which the work it starts continues. The worker posts back `WorkerEvent`s.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:57.098Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:08:57.098Z"}
